eId":760490113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":3716100202,"text":"今は最近私がいつも歌ってる曲を練習してるの。メロディは覚えてる？","nextNodeIds":[760490114]},{"nodeId":760490114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":3185965738,"text":"それか…キミの得意な曲でもいいよ。この子たちにほかの国の曲を聴かせてあげられる機会はあんまりないし、私も聴いてみたい。","nextNodeIds":[760490115]},{"nodeId":760490115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3005180010,"text":"（何を弾こう…）","nextNodeIds":[760490202,760490801]},{"nodeId":760490202,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2586285570,"text":"コロンビーナがよく口ずさんでたあの歌…","nextNodeIds":[760490201]},{"nodeId":760490201,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3578998170,"text":"（どんな感情を込めて弾こう…）","nextNodeIds":[760490603,760490701]},{"nodeId":760490603,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3424614634,"text":"穏やかな曲調…","nextNodeIds":[760490604]},{"nodeId":760490604,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":2355375010,"text":"素敵。私がよく歌ってるメロディ、覚えてくれたんだね。","nextNodeIds":[760490605]},{"nodeId":760490605,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3927378426,"text":"へへっ、おまえの歌は上手だからな。たまにこっそり聴いてるんだ！","nextNodeIds":[760490606]},{"nodeId":760490606,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":3181297618,"text":"月霊もうっとりしてるみたい。ちゃんとお手本を覚えてくれたかな。","nextNodeIds":[760490607]},{"nodeId":760490607,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":2745433354,"text":"また教えてもらうかも。","nextNodeIds":[760490608]},{"nodeId":760490608,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":1978945250,"text":"手を出して。","nextNodeIds":[760490609]},{"nodeId":760490609,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3175521098,"text":"えっ？オイラたちボランティアでやってるから、授業料はいらないぞ！","nextNodeIds":[760490610]},{"nodeId":760490610,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":2567891362,"text":"授業料？","nextNodeIds":[760490611]},{"nodeId":760490611,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":2274589514,"text":"私はただ、きれいなメロディには美しい月光が合うって思っただけ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":760490701,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":890029826,"text":"楽しい曲調…","nextNodeIds":[760490702]},{"nodeId":760490702,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":3665717202,"text":"もう終わっちゃったの？まだまだ聴いてたい…","nextNodeIds":[760490703]},{"nodeId":760490703,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":4231912434,"text":"これは私が唯一覚えてる「子守唄」だっていうのは、前に言ったよね。","nextNodeIds":[760490704]},{"nodeId":760490704,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":2258584194,"text":"唄に込められた意味はわからないけど…キミの演奏を聴いてると、月の上で私を待ってる答えは、少なくとも素敵なものだって感じられた。","nextNodeIds":[760490705]},{"nodeId":760490705,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":1034048802,"text":"手を出して。","nextNodeIds":[760490706]},{"nodeId":760490706,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1030996010,"text":"見返りなんていらないぞ。","nextNodeIds":[760490707]},{"nodeId":760490707,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":2155818994,"text":"ううん、このメロディに美しい月明かりを添えたいだけ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":760490801,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":254943778,"text":"異国の曲を演奏する…","nextNodeIds":[760490802]},{"nodeId":760490802,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":3628717402,"text":"不思議な感じ。昔、たまにこんな感じのメロディを聞いてたけど…キミが弾くとまた違った感じがする。","nextNodeIds":[760490803]},{"nodeId":760490803,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン